{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a shooter but put off by the insane skill required by the faster games? Space Mash could be for you, a wild bullet-hell shooter that allows the player to slow the action right down at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Mash features traditional bullet hell essentials such as non-random levels that enable you to memorise enemy attacks, aimed and fixed-pattern bullets with bullet-herding game-play, points for bullet-grazing, enforced one-credit clear on all 10 levels, tap-dodging, single player shot mechanic to maximise the benefits of point-blank attacks, hidden bonuses and of course, end-of-level bosses with multiple attack patterns.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926440?t=1759829110","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926440/93235737093d4a18e019fafcbacfc665ac3ccf8b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759829110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926440/f0fa8c8c22c5e0979b3967f771bdd4afc8b6461d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759829110","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926440/f0fa8c8c22c5e0979b3967f771bdd4afc8b6461d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759829110","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3991370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a shooter but put off by the insane skill required by the faster games? Space Mash could be for you, a wild bullet-hell shooter that allows the player to slow the action righ